{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25667","headline":"惊雪 · 陆畅","name":"惊雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪得北风急，前庭如月辉。\n天人宁许巧，翦水作花飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆畅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷四七八、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》陆畅条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}